{"text": "jail visit 11/8 2:10pm - pod C - abt 35 min. notes rough, will clean up monday\n\nclient: tyrese m. goodwine, goes by reese. dob 5/30/01. booking # 2025-0044187\narrested thurs 11/6 abt 11pm, traffic stop on rivers ave near the walmart. arresting ofc mulvaney-luz badge 4418\ncharges: poss w/ intent (cocaine, \"28 grams\" per warrant), unlawful carry. warrants 2025A1010204418 and ...419\nbond set at $75,000 surety at the hearing fri am. family cant make it. mom has maybe 2 grand. ask abt ROR / bond reduction motion - rule 5 wasnt read to him he says\n\nhis version:\n- car isnt his. its shanices - girlfriend - shanice albury - silver altima tag TKR 418 (SC). he borrowed it to get to work\n- works at ashley river tire & lube on dorchester rd, 2nd shift, clocked out 10:30. boss is \"mr. ray\". GET TIMECARD\n- bag was under pass. seat. says its deandre's - deandre polite aka \"dre\" - shanices cousin - who had the car all day weds. dre is on federal probation so nobody wants to say it\n- gun: says he never saw it. glovebox was locked, shanice has the only key??\n- cops searched w/o asking. bodycam should show. no consent form 4.01 signed\n\npriors (he says): juvie adjudication 2017 (joyriding), simple possession 2021 - PTI completed. nothing violent. CHECK NCIC\n\nhealth: type 1 diabetic. jail hasnt given him insulin since booking - nurse said \"tomorrow\" twice. he looked bad. CALL MEDICAL TODAY. also takes lexapro\nfamily: lives w/ his grandmother, ms. hyacinth, 2204 ranger dr apt b n. charleston 29405. she's 90 and he does her shopping - use for bond motion\nphones: shanice 843-555-0170. grandmother landline 843 555 0104. his phone was seized - passcode is 053001 IF we decide to consent to a dump (dont yet)\nhis cashapp shows he got paid $412 thurs - explains the cash on him ($388)\n\nnext: prelim 12/4 9am courtroom 2B. bond motion asap. subpoena tire shop cameras before they overwrite (7 days!!)", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "338 words", "notes": [], "na